Answer: That looks correct, but it is much easier to see that \begin{align}4(n+1)^2>4n^2&\implies(4(n+1)^2)!>(4n^2)!\\&\implies\frac1{(4(n+1)^2)!}<\frac1{(4n^2)!}.\end{align}

